    "body": "> How do you get FileList then? Can you construct one in WebKit and Blink?\r\n\r\nWe can get it only by ```files``` of another ```HTMLInputElement``` instance, or ```files``` of [DataTranfer](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#the-datatransfer-interface).  There are no other ways AFAIK.\r\n",
