    "body": "As of https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/36fe3be5307e91c7cefa3491835d890c3424613a this technique is used in Blink layout tests to verify multipart encoding for form POSTs with file uploads. Is the `DataTransferItemList` mutability standard enough to use in a web platform test? If so, I'd be happy to move those upload tests to WPT which appears to lack coverage for form-based file upload.\r\n\r\n/cc @pwnall @inexorabletash ",
